  "description": "Dumped by her ex and labeled \"frigid,\" Somin wants nothing to do with love—until one impulsive night with Jaeyul, a handsome notorious flirt, changes everything. It was supposed to be a one-time mistake... so why can't she stop thinking about him?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \nR19: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1286012029), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13525463), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Romanceless), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/absent_romance), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000076237)  \nR15: [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000080825), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69937000) \n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[English](https://manta.net/en/series/love-without-romance-full-ver?seriesId=4540), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/absence-of-romantic-love/list?title_no=9597)",
